Really, most people here use the e-mail interface? I hate getting stuff 
like this cluttering up my inbox, I get enough in there as it is. So yeah, 
I've been using the web interface like a forum, so that's why a deletion 
means more to me. But I suppose if it doesn't to everyone else, it's not as 
big of a deal. I'd still like to know why it was deleted though, what's 
wrong with that?

In any case, and back to the original topic, it turns out most of this 
discussion is moot. I've since discovered that there already is a word 
entered into jbovlaste, in 2003. Now I admit I see now that I should rely 
less on the pdf dictionary (even if it is more convenient) and use the 
website more, but if someone had told me or reminded me of that in the 
first place, that would have answered my original question. Strange that no 
one did. Oh well, I have my answer.


